# To remember commands

## List Commands in Common Directories
ls /usr/bin
ls /bin /sbin /usr/sbin

## List All Available Commands
compgen -c

## List Installed Packages (Debian/Ubuntu)
dpkg --get-selections

## Search for Keywords in Man Pages
man -k <keyword>

## List Command Descriptions
man -k . | less

## Search for Keywords with `apropos`
apropos <keyword>
apropos .

## Check the Type of a Command
type <command>

## List Functions Defined in `bash`
declare -f

## Find Executable Files
find /usr/bin -type f -executable

## Check the Location of Commands
command -v <command>

## Example Search with `whatis`
whatis <command>

## List a summarize with common use
tldr <command> [<subcommand>]

## View a cheatsheet
cheat <command>

## List Files in `/usr/local/bin`
ls /usr/local/bin

## List Commands with `which`
which <command>

## List All Shell Built-in Commands
help

## Find Commands with Specific Extensions
find /usr/bin -name "*.sh"

## List All Available Shells
cat /etc/shells

## List All Installed Software (RPM-based Systems)
rpm -qa

## List All Installed Packages (Debian/Ubuntu)
dpkg -l

## Search for a Package by Name (Debian/Ubuntu)
apt search <package-name>

## Show Package Information (Debian/Ubuntu)
apt show <package-name>

## List All Installed Packages (RPM-based Systems)
rpm -qa

## Search for a Package by Name (RPM-based Systems)
yum search <package-name>

## Show Package Information (RPM-based Systems)
yum info <package-name>

## List All Installed Packages (Arch Linux)
pacman -Q

## Search for a Package by Name (Arch Linux)
pacman -Ss <package-name>

## Show Package Information (Arch Linux)
pacman -Qi <package-name>

## List Packages Installed via Snap
snap list

## List Packages Installed via Flatpak
flatpak list

## Search for Utilities Installed via Homebrew (macOS/Linux)
brew list

## Search for a Package by Name (Homebrew)
brew search <package-name>

# Searching for Utilities Installed by Language-Specific Package Managers

## Python (pip)

### List Installed Packages
pip list

### Search for a Package
pip search <package-name>

### Show Package Information
pip show <package-name>

## Node.js (npm)

### List Installed Packages
npm list -g --depth=0

### Search for a Package
npm search <package-name>

### Show Package Information
npm info <package-name>

## Ruby (gem)

### List Installed Gems
gem list

### Search for a Gem
gem search <gem-name>

### Show Gem Information
gem specification <gem-name>

## PHP (Composer)

### List Installed Packages
composer show

### Search for a Package
composer search <package-name>

### Show Package Information
composer show <package-name>

## Rust (Cargo)

### List Installed Packages
cargo install --list

### Search for a Package
cargo search <package-name>

### Show Package Information
cargo metadata --format-version 1

## Go (Go Modules)

### List Installed Modules
go list -m all

### Show Module Information
go list -m <module-name>

## Elixir (Mix)

### List Installed Dependencies
mix deps

### Show Dependency Information
mix deps.info <dependency-name>

## .NET (NuGet)

### List Installed Packages
dotnet list package

### Search for a Package
dotnet nuget search <package-name>

### Show Package Information
dotnet nuget info <package-name>
